  "id": "ssrpm-arbitrary-password-reset",
  "name": "SSRPM - Arbitary Password Reset on Default Client Interface Installation",
  "author": "vince-isec",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "description": "The default installation of the Client Web Interface, which is provided alongside the COM SSRPM service, defines a hard-coded secret token for the Import endpoint. This endpoint allows registering new accounts or overwriting existing onboarding data for an arbitrary account, which ultimately allows changing the password of an arbitrary account.\n",
